# ClearClef design

Read [docs/design.md](../docs/design.md) before changing public catalog, viewer, or shared UI styling.

- Canvas `#f5f5f5`, ink pill CTAs, no pastel orbs.
- Newsreader 300 for display (work titles); Geist for UI; Geist Mono for catalog metadata and colophon.
- Catalog index is a composer-grouped contents list with hairline rows and desktop incipit thumbnails.
- Engraved page-1 SVG is the incipit thumbnail. No Verovio on list pages.
- Dark mode: lamp on a stand — system `prefers-color-scheme`; dark stone chrome, engraved page stays white; never invert SVG.
